      "body": {
        "serial": "container_containeritembody_5e81f5a55ec25702794958",
        "body": "<div class=\"grid-row\"><div class=\"col-6\"><p><strong>Math<\/strong><\/p><p>7 + 12 =\u00a0\u00a0{{interaction_textentryinteraction_5e81f5a563d50749591392}}\u00a0[integer]<\/p><p>15 - 4\u00a0=\u00a0{{interaction_textentryinteraction_5e81f5a564b46703944872}}\u00a0[integer]<\/p><p>5 \u00d7 2.5 =\u00a0{{interaction_textentryinteraction_5e81f5a564be5797567934}}\u00a0[float]<\/p><p>16\u00a0\u00f7 4\u00a0=\u00a0{{interaction_textentryinteraction_5e81f5a564c71755935564}}\u00a0[float]<\/p><p>20 ÷3\u00a0<\/sup>=\u00a0\u00a0{{interaction_textentryinteraction_5e81f5a564cf8013919457}}\u00a0[float]<\/p><p>\u00a0<\/p><\/div><div class=\"col-6\"><p><strong>Poetry contest<\/strong><\/p><p>I imagine this midnight moment's\u00a0{{interaction_textentryinteraction_5e81f5a564d7d967216145}}\u00a0<\/p><p>Something\u00a0{{interaction_textentryinteraction_5e81f5a564e01937139488}}\u00a0is alive<\/p><p>Beside the \u00a0{{interaction_textentryinteraction_5e81f5a564e84573506107}}\u00a0's loneliness<\/p><p>And this blank page where my fingers {{interaction_textentryinteraction_5e81f5a564f88781140909}}. [max length constraint: 4 chars]<\/p><p>\u00a0<\/p><\/div><\/div><div class=\"grid-row\"><div class=\"col-7\"><p><strong>Binary guessing<\/strong><\/p><p>How many candies are in the jar? (Write your guess in binary)<\/p><p>\u00a0{{interaction_textentryinteraction_5e81f5a56500f554203127}}\u00a0<\/p><p>[integer, base 2, pattern constraint: [01]+]<\/p><\/div><div class=\"col-5\"><p>{{img_5e723a6de7284750521600}}<\/p><\/div><\/div><div class=\"grid-row\"><div class=\"col-12\"><p>\u00a0<\/p><p><strong>Colour theory<\/strong><\/p><p>Express the decimal value 201 as a hexadecimal string<\/p><p>\u00a0{{interaction_textentryinteraction_5e81f5a56500f554200000}}\u00a0[integer, base 16]<\/p><\/div><\/div>",
